T: Shepherd of Tender Youth
T: (also known as Shepherd of Eager Youth)
C: Words: Clement of Alexandria, ca200.  Translated by Henry Martyn Dexter, 1846, alt..
C: Music: 'Italian Hymn' Felice de Giardini, 1769.  Setting: "The Methodist Sunday School Hymnal", 1911.
C: copyright: public domain.  This score is a part of the Open Hymnal Project, 2025 Revision.
S: Music source: 'The Methodist Sunday School Hymnal', 1911 Hymn 1.
S: Lyrics source: Hymns for the Church of Christ, 1853, Hymn 715, alt.
